  "details": "1. Use an avatar that has extra objects on its root (not the armature or hips). This is common in avatars with any kind of system, like props and followers. It's also seen in lots of Final IK avatars.\n\n2. Attempt to add an accessory to one of those objects.\n\nHere are some avatars that can reproduce this bug:\n\n- https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_6133d779-0276-4f5f-a00b-7038fbd0f3c1\n\n- Accessories can only be added to the upper body. https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_a2791e9b-c4e2-42ef-ad88-ccfef213fe8f\n\n- Accessories can't be added properly at all. The main skeleton isn't contained in the humanoid. https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_398aaafe-14f0-45a1-8b0e-fdf821d5dbb3",
